/T (The Multi-Door Safety Interlock System is a purely hardware-based vehicle safety solution. It prevents the vehicle engine from starting unless ALL four doors are fully closed and latched.)
/E (The Multi-Door Safety Interlock System is a purely hardware-based vehicle safety solution. It prevents the vehicle engine from starting unless ALL four doors are fully closed and latched.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
684 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 460 0 R
/T (At its heart lies the 74HC08 Quad AND Gate IC. The four door sensors \(represented by DIP switches\) feed into a chain of AND gates. The engine enable signal \(LED\) goes HIGH only when every single input is HIGH.)
/E (At its heart lies the 74HC08 Quad AND Gate IC. The four door sensors \(represented by DIP switches\) feed into a chain of AND gates. The engine enable signal \(LED\) goes HIGH only when every single input is HIGH.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
